   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs with tools",
     "texto": [
      "**Menggunting** means to cut using scissors and **menjepit**, to hold with a clip. The prefix **meN-** also appears in action verbs you already know, but not all of them express using a tool."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Direction verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Mengudara** means to rise or take to the air; **mendarat**, to land; **menepi**, to move toward the edge or pull aside. There is no single English translation for **meN-**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
